-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/BGSI> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Basalt. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Paleogene Period (66-23.04 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/CDUBH> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Volcaniclastic-breccia. Bedrock. Occurs onshore. Formed during the Paleocene Epoch (Palaeogene Period) (66-56 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/EIGL> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Basalt and basalt lava and trace dolerite, mugearite and olivine-basalt. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Paleocene Epoch (Palaeogene Period) (66-56 Ma BP)."@en .
